<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Norsk Hydro cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Norsk Hydro cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan analysts Nick Davies, Carol Bell, Greg Quine and Katie Flanagan have cut Norway's Norsk Hydro A/S to market performer from buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Hydro's 1996 results disappointed in all divisions,&quot; they wrote in a Feb 24 analysis.</p>
<p>-- They reduced their earnings-per-share estimates to 30.1 krone from 35.1 for 1997 and to 32.7 krone from 35.3 next year.</p>
<p>-- The company's American Depositary Receipts were off one to 51-5/8 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
